---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Now" description="What Baixin Guo is working on right now">
  <div class="container-content py-16">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">

      <span class="section-label mb-4">Now</span>
      <h1 class="mb-2">What I'm Working On</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] mb-8">Updated August 2026</p>

        <div class="card-static mb-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-secondary)]"></span>
            <span class="font-mono text-[0.6rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-secondary)] uppercase tracking-wider">Frozen</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-[1.05rem] mb-1">InteractionKit v1.0.0 Released</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)]">InteractionKit is released and frozen. Knowledge Compiler remains supporting evidence infrastructure with partial provenance recovery.</p>
        </div>

      <div class="space-y-6">

        <div class="card-static">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-primary)]"></span>
            <span class="font-mono text-[0.6rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] uppercase tracking-wider">Human validation preparation</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-[1.05rem] mb-1">CheckMyCoach Human Validation</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)]">Preparing human validation of CheckMyCoach, with attention to whether its target-removal and retention checks agree with human judgments. The prototype and a bounded development run are available as system evidence. Human evaluation has not yet been conducted.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-secondary)]"></span>
            <span class="font-mono text-[0.6rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-secondary)] uppercase tracking-wider">Frozen</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-[1.05rem] mb-1">Historical context</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)]">M0 remains frozen, MaxFitCalib-Bench is audit history, CalTrust is frozen and simulation-only, and the Precision Illusion behavioral thread is retired.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-gold)]"></span>
            <span class="font-mono text-[0.6rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-gold)] uppercase tracking-wider">Building</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-[1.05rem] mb-1">PI Discovery Engine</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)]">Streamlit web app for finding and tracking potential PhD advisors. v0.3 with email pipeline.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-static">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-secondary)]"></span>
            <span class="font-mono text-[0.6rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-secondary)] uppercase tracking-wider">Research</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-[1.05rem] mb-1">Separate collaborative research</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)]">My baseball research collaboration with Professor Lorena Martin produced two SABR abstracts. The related manuscripts are in preparation.</p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mt-8 italic">Inspired by <a href="https://nownownow.com" class="underline hover:text-[var(--color-primary)]">nownownow.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
